- when the user said “the amount of text for the video part of the landing page is to much. just keep the background” -> make the landing video visually driven and remove surrounding explanatory copy by default. [Task 2]
- when the user added “give the background some texture in that section though to make it feel interesting” -> retain restrained visual interest through subtle texture after simplifying copy. [Task 2]
