- `devenv up` uses Qwik/Vite at `http://127.0.0.1:5180` and Storybook at `http://127.0.0.1:6010`; Convex dev targets the configured cloud deployment rather than a local backend port. Story discovery is `../src/**/*.stories.@(ts|tsx)`, with theme plus phone/tablet/desktop viewports. [Task 4]
